    "updated_at": "2017-08-15T16:19:52Z",
    "body": "I haven't looked at blame, but this may have been defined before unions. There's also some people that don't care about specifying return values. Note that if we wanted we could make that even more precise. There's only a couple of Element subclasses that can be returned. Not sure if that's worth it though.",
