    "created_at": "2017-08-15T17:47:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-15T17:47:02Z",
    "body": "It can return: `HTMLAppletElement`, `HTMLEmbedElement`, `HTMLFormElement`, `HTMLIFrameElement`, `HTMLImageElement`, and `HTMLObjectElement`.  That seems unnecessarily cumbersome to put in the IDL.\r\n\r\nI actually think Gecko's implementation would be simplified if this was a union, although I haven't tried it.",
